{
 "duration": 26.562,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Owen had a beanie and a neck gaiter.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.245
  },
  {
   "text": "On the open ridge, the wind found the gaps anyway: his ears, his cheeks, the strip of neck in between.",
   "start": 2.595,
   "end": 8.879
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten minutes in, his ears were numb.",
   "start": 9.229,
   "end": 11.182
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 11.582,
   "end": 12.509
  },
  {
   "text": "Cover up before the wind hits.",
   "start": 12.809,
   "end": 14.401
  },
  {
   "text": "A balaclava does it in one piece: hood over the ears, a panel over cheeks and chin, a long neck tucked into your collar.",
   "start": 14.701,
   "end": 22.217
  },
  {
   "text": "Owen crossed warm.",
   "start": 22.717,
   "end": 23.831
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 24.331,
   "end": 26.362
  }
 ],
